{"title":"Career Roadmap · Space Law Researcher","role":"Space Law Researcher","summary":"A Space Law Researcher studies the legal, regulatory, policy, commercial, and international-law issues created by activities in outer space.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Aviation / Space / Maritime Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Space Law Researcher studies the legal, regulatory, policy, commercial, and international-law issues created by activities in outer space."},{"type":"p","text":"The field combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","International Law","Space Policy","Technology","Research","Regulation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Space Law Researcher may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space treaties"},{"text":"Satellite regulation"},{"text":"Space activities"},{"text":"Launch services"},{"text":"Space debris"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Satellite communications"},{"text":"Earth observation"},{"text":"Space insurance"},{"text":"Commercial spaceflight"},{"text":"Space resource utilization"},{"text":"Liability for space activities"},{"text":"Registration of space objects"},{"text":"Spectrum/orbital issues"},{"text":"Space cybersecurity"},{"text":"Space sustainability"},{"text":"Military uses of space"},{"text":"AI and autonomous spacecraft"},{"text":"Lunar and planetary activities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Research institutes"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Space-policy organizations"},{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"Space agencies"},{"text":"Aerospace companies"},{"text":"Satellite companies"},{"text":"Space startups"},{"text":"International organizations"},{"text":"Law firms"},{"text":"Policy and regulatory consultancies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India, students can build knowledge around the Indian space ecosystem, national space policy and regulatory framework, while also developing international space-law expertise."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Integrated Law Degree"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA LLB / B.Sc LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB","International Law","Aviation + Space Law","International Space Treaties","Research + Policy Writing","Space Law Internship / Research Assistantship","Junior Space Law Researcher","Space Law Researcher","Senior Researcher / Space Policy Analyst","Space Law / Policy Specialist","Research Lead / Space Policy Advisor"]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Tort law"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal writing"},{"text":"International relations awareness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong academic writing skills from the beginning."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — International Law"},{"type":"p","text":"International law is the foundation of space law."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public international law"},{"text":"State sovereignty"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"},{"text":"State responsibility"},{"text":"Treaties"},{"text":"International organizations"},{"text":"International dispute resolution"},{"text":"International humanitarian law"},{"text":"Law of the sea"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Treaty obligations"},{"text":"Customary international law"},{"text":"State responsibility"},{"text":"International jurisdiction"},{"text":"Diplomatic relations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Aviation & Space Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin specialization in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Law"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airspace"},{"text":"Aircraft registration"},{"text":"Aviation safety"},{"text":"Airline regulation"},{"text":"International aviation agreements"},{"text":"Passenger rights"},{"text":"Aviation liability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Space Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Outer space activities"},{"text":"Satellite operations"},{"text":"Launch activities"},{"text":"Space objects"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Liability"},{"text":"Space debris"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Telecommunications"},{"text":"Commercial space activities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Aviation and space law overlap in some areas, but space law is a distinct and highly internationalized field."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Space Treaties & Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the major international space-law framework."},{"type":"p","text":"Important treaty instruments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Outer Space Treaty"},{"text":"Rescue Agreement"},{"text":"Liability Convention"},{"text":"Registration Convention"},{"text":"Moon Agreement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand the principles behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Peaceful uses of outer space"},{"text":"Non-appropriation"},{"text":"State responsibility"},{"text":"State liability"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Assistance/rescue"},{"text":"International cooperation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact legal interpretation of treaties can be complex, so students should learn to distinguish binding treaty obligations from soft-law principles, guidelines, and policy proposals."},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Research & Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal research methodology"},{"text":"Policy research"},{"text":"Comparative space law"},{"text":"Regulatory analysis"},{"text":"Academic writing"},{"text":"Research papers"},{"text":"Policy briefs"},{"text":"Treaty analysis"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Space-industry regulation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should graduate with a space-law research portfolio, not just a degree."}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"International Law"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Space Law"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Legal Writing"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Treaty Interpretation"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"International Relations"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Space Policy"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Aviation Law"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Maritime Law"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Policy Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Research Methodology"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Basic–Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Space Technology"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Scientific Literacy"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Public Speaking"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Space Law Research Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Research Question","Identify Legal Issue","International Treaties","National Laws & Regulations","State Practice","Case Law / Decisions","Academic Literature","Space-Industry Practice","Comparative Analysis","Legal / Policy Assessment","Research Paper / Policy Brief","Recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"A good researcher should not rely on one source."}]},{"heading":"Major Space-Law Domains","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Satellite Regulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Satellite licensing"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Communications"},{"text":"Earth observation"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Data policies"},{"text":"Satellite operations"}]}]},{"heading":"Launch 