estial bodies are separate legal questions."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should analyze treaties, national legislation, state practice, and competing legal interpretations rather than presenting one interpretation as universally settled."}]},{"heading":"Commercial Space Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Commercial space is expanding rapidly."},{"type":"p","text":"Study contracts involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Satellite operators"},{"text":"Launch providers"},{"text":"Space startups"},{"text":"Insurance companies"},{"text":"Ground stations"},{"text":"Data providers"},{"text":"Payload customers"},{"text":"Government agencies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential contracts include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Launch agreements"},{"text":"Satellite manufacturing agreements"},{"text":"Satellite service agreements"},{"text":"Data licensing"},{"text":"Insurance agreements"},{"text":"Ground-station contracts"},{"text":"Technology licensing"},{"text":"Joint ventures"}]}]},{"heading":"Space Insurance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand basic principles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Launch insurance"},{"text":"In-orbit insurance"},{"text":"Third-party liability"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Insurance contracts"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Space asset valuation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A law student does not need to become an actuary but should understand how legal liability and financial risk interact."}]},{"heading":"Remote Sensing & Earth Observation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Research legal and policy questions around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Earth observation"},{"text":"Data ownership"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"National security"},{"text":"Commercial imagery"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Disaster management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agriculture"},{"text":"Climate m