── Space Communications"},{"type":"p","text":"RESEARCH"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Legal Research"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Comparative Research"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Policy Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Academic Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Policy Briefing"},{"type":"p","text":"ANALYTICS"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"├── GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Data Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Basic Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"EMERGING AREAS"},{"type":"p","text":"├── AI & Space"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Space Cybersecurity"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Autonomous Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Lunar Resources"},{"type":"p","text":"└── Commercial Space Stations"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Integrated Law","International Law","Space Law","Space Policy + Space Technology","Research Projects","Space-Law Internship","Research Assistant","Space Law Researcher","Senior Researcher / Space Policy Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a future-ready career, an especially strong combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["International Space Law","Commercial Space Law","Space Policy","Space Technology","Space Sustainability","AI/Cybersecurity","Research & Policy Writing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This positions the graduate for emerging legal questions surrounding commercial spaceflight, satellite constellations, lunar exploration, space resources, orbital sustainability, space cybersecurity, autonomous spacecraft, and the rapidly expanding private space sector."}]}]}